}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le06ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le06ob08re2img06.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le06ob08re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "Subject Line - A Date To Remember</br></br>Hey Sally,</br></br>I had to tell you about my date last Saturday.</br></br>Marco and I went for a hike up Table Ridge Mountain. I was waiting in the parking lot for half an hour before he arrived. I was a little bothered, but when he showed up with a single, red rose, I forgave him immediately.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le06ob08re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "Marco's so sweet. Have I told you how athletic he is too?  I'm sure he must spend a lot of time in the gym.  He was taking two steps at a time while I struggled to catch my breath. We were winding our way to the top when we heard a strange noise in the bushes. There, we found a blue jay with a broken wing.", "id": 2, "time": "23000", "image": "engenn5le06ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Marco took off his shirt and wrapped up the bird.  We decided to head back down the mountain to find a vet.  Sally, he was so tender and gentle with the injured animal. What an angel!</br></br>Chat soon,</br>\nVanessa", "id": 3, "time": "46000", "image": "engenn5le06ob08re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le06ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Descriptive Paragraphs</span>", "id": 1, "time": "1", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Different types sentences</span>", "id": 2, "time": "11000", "image": ""}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Makes a New Friend"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Date with Marco"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le06ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Writing a Descriptive Paragraph"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you write a descriptive paragraph, use different types of sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are four sentence types:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Simple</span></br> Simple sentences do not have conjunctions (and, but, or). </br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Marco climbed the mountain.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Compound</span></br> Compound sentences have two statements that are connected by a conjunction.</br> <span class=\"italic\">Example: Vanessa waited in the parking lot and Marco had a coffee.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Complex</span></br> A complex sentence has one complete sentence (independent clause) and at least one incomplete sentence (dependent clause).</br> The two clauses are connected by a word like <span class=\"italic\">which, who, although, if, or since</span>. </br><span class=\"italic\">Example: If you turn left at the intersection, you will see the mountain ahead of you.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Compound - Complex</span></br> A compound-complex sentence contains at least one dependent clause and more than one independent clause.</br> <span class=\"italic\">Example: Marco, who arrived last month, met his co-worker, and then he decided to take her on a date.</span>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Past Tense and Past Continuous Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You make the Past Continuous tense by using the Past tense of the verb <span class=\"strong\">to be</span> and the -ing form of the verb. </br></br>You use the Past Continuous tense to talk about:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol> <li>something which continued before and after another action </br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Marco and Vanessa were climbing up the mountain  when they heard a noise in the bush.</span></li> <li>something that happened before and after a time period </br><span class=\"italic\">Example: It was eight o'clock. I was writing a letter.</span> <li> something that continued for some time</br> <span class=\"italic\">Example: My knee was aching.</li> <li>something that was happening again and again </br><span class=\"italic\">Example: I was jogging every day, three times a day.</span></li></ol>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "parking lot "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area outside a building for parking cars and  trucks"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa waited in the parking lot."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you are doing outside activities."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to bother"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to cause someone to feel worried, annoyed or concerned"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa was a little bothered."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tender "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very loving and gentle; showing affection and love for someone or something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Marco was very tender with the bird."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "angel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a spiritual being that is a messenger from God"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He is such an angel!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to struggle"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to try very hard to do, achieve, or deal with something that is difficult or that causes problems"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa struggled to keep up with Marco."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to wind"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to follow a series of curves and turns"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We were winding our way to the top."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a part of an animal's body that is used for flying or gliding"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The bird's wing was broken."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "catch my breath"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "use when you find it difficult to breathe"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa needed to catch her breath."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob08aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a 75-word descriptive paragraph about a friend."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include information about their appearance and personality."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use simple, compound and complex sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use paragraph structure."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a descriptive paragraph about a friend."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use proper sentence structure."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I proofread my work."}]}], "type": "sena"}